OL,3,GNEWSADeath of man found seriously
OL,4,Ainjured 'suspicious'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a man whose body was found
OL,7,Fat a home in Birmingham is being
OL,8,Ftreated as suspicious, police have
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Long Street,
OL,12,FSparkbrook, at about 11:00 BST on
OL,13,FFriday after a 22-year-old man was
OL,14,Ffound with serious injuries. He was
OL,15,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,17,FInquiries to establish the cause of his
OL,18,Fdeath were ongoing, said West Midlands
OL,19,FPolice, and a post-mortem would be
OL,20,Fcarried out.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
