OL,3,GNEWSADeath of man found seriously
OL,4,Ainjured 'suspicious'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Detectives are treating it as
OL,7,Fsuspicious, and no arrests have been
OL,8,Fmade at this time," added a
OL,9,Fspokesperson.
